      "content": "that sounds like a bit of a legal gray area then. basically they'd have to prove i'm pulling stuff straight from my head instead of just knowing how to code? it feels like they could try to claim anything i do is a breach if it's too similar. is there any way to make this clause more specific so i'm actually protected?",
